WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:02.002
Narr: From Apple TV Plus-

00:00:02.044 --> 00:00:03.253
What are we looking for again?

00:00:03.795 --> 00:00:05.005
That, a Gharial.

00:00:06.548 --> 00:00:08.842
Jane: There's only 600 of them left
in the whole world.

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:10.719
Turn back! Turn back!

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:12.012
[screams]

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:15.015
Jane: Graybeard!

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:16.683
Mom!

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:18.685
You know chimpanzees can't swim.

00:00:19.186 --> 00:00:20.979
Narr: Based on the mission
of Jane Goodall.

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:22.648
Jane: The animals are in danger.

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:24.399
Every year there are less
and less of them.

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:25.442
We have to help them.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:27.903
Jane: If everyone worked together,
we could save them.

00:00:27.903 --> 00:00:28.820
[chimpanzee sounds]

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:31.073
Only if we understand
will we care.

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:32.783
Only if we care will we help.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.034
Jane Goodall said that.

00:00:34.409 --> 00:00:35.285
Mom: I know,

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:36.703
you recite it every morning.

00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:39.456
♪♪

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:40.249
Let's go.

00:00:40.249 --> 00:00:41.959
Jane: Imagining, let's you
picture something

00:00:41.959 --> 00:00:43.252
you've never thought of before.

00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:44.169
David: Whoah!

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:45.629
Let’s save some bees.

00:00:45.629 --> 00:00:46.296
Ready, Greybeard?

00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:49.549
David: Can we put our plan into action?

00:00:49.675 --> 00:00:50.676
Jane: Ready if you are.

00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:52.135
[screams]

00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:54.304
It's cute...

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.598
in an ugly kind of way.

00:00:57.599 --> 00:01:00.602
♪♪

00:01:01.103 --> 00:01:02.896
Narr: Imagine a better world,

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:06.066
and journey, to save one
species at a time.

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:07.192
Yeah!

00:01:08.402 --> 00:01:10.320
We’re trying to figure out why
they like to come out at night.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:12.030
Sounds like quite the mystery.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.365
Have fun saving the world.

00:01:13.365 --> 00:01:14.283
Together, huh?

00:01:14.283 --> 00:01:14.866
Together.

00:01:14.866 --> 00:01:15.701
Run!

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:20.080
♪♪

00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:23.500
Jane!

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:26.253
I'm never letting you
out of my sight again.

00:01:26.712 --> 00:01:27.587
Jane.

00:01:30.716 --> 00:01:32.884
Why does everything we
try to save attack us?

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:36.096
♪♪

